# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The asset packs must not be published.
#
# Super Retro Ranch (free tier) and Cute Fantasy (free) both say, in as many
# words, that you may not redistribute the assets — modified or not. Pushing
# the pack folders to a public repository is redistribution.
#
# Using the art inside the game is fine, and that is what ships: the built
# Apocalypse-Farm.html carries only the cropped sprites it actually draws,
# baked into a single base64 atlas.
#
# These are ignored going forward. Files already committed stay in the history
# until they are untracked — see README, "Publishing this".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

